    "body": "So my workaround is to yank out the permissions I don't need. Publish it locally `./gradlew calf-core:publishToMavenLocal calf-ui:publishToMavenLocal calf-permissions:publishToMavenLocal calf-file-picker:publishToMavenLocal calf-io:publishToMavenLocal` with a few tweaks to the convention plugin to ignore signing and setting a proper version and then consuming it from my app.",
