    "updated_at": "2026-03-22T14:49:04Z",
    "body": "I've been working on modularizing the permissions to fix this issue.\nStarting from 0.10.0 you can import only the permissions that you need, there's no migration needed.\nYou can remove `calf-permissions` dependency and use the modules for the permissions that you need (ex: `calf-permissions-camera`...)\n\nCheck the docs for more details:\nhttps://mohamedrejeb.github.io/Calf/permissions/",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
